[{"answer":"Hey, Cindy! Have you finished the exam?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I have. Whew!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Was it hard?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, yes. It was hard, pretty hard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you pass?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know. Mrs. Lester didn't tell me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/6.mp3"},{"answer":"What questions did she ask?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/7.mp3"},{"answer":"First she asked me what my name was.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/8.mp3"},{"answer":"That was easy, wasn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, except I couldn't remember!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Then she asked me where I came from,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and how long it took to get here from my country.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/12.mp3"},{"answer":"And what else did she ask?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/13.mp3"},{"answer":"She asked how long I'd been studying English here in Canada,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/14.mp3"},{"answer":"and she asked how I would use English in the future.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, yes, go on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Then she asked me to explain the difference between my country and Canada.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm trying to remember.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes! She asked if I spoke any other language.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that all?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, there were a lot of other questions. She asked me what my hobbies were,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/22.mp3"},{"answer":"where I visited in Canada. Then I was asked to read a passage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/23.mp3"},{"answer":"What did she say at the end?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm. Let's see...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, Yes! She asked me to tell you to go in, right away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/41-oral-exams-2022-03-07-21-18-39/26.mp3"}]
